@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Laboratory Work Submission Process

start

:Open laboratory task;
:Read requirements;

if (Requirements are clear?) then (yes)
    :Create work plan;
else (no)
    :Ask for clarification or reread task;
    :Create work plan;
endif

:Prepare project repository;
:Implement required work;
:Create UML diagrams;
:Write documentation;
:Run checks;
:Commit changes;
:Push to GitHub;

if (Deadline has not passed?) then (yes)
    :Submit repository link;
    :Wait for review;
else (no)
    :Submit late and explain delay;
endif

if (Teacher accepts work?) then (yes)
    :Receive grade;
else (needs fixes)
    :Fix comments;
    :Commit and push fixes;
    :Resubmit work;
endif

stop

@enduml
